# Harness output. Every run writes a timestamped JSON here and they are
# measurements of one deployment at one moment, not source.
bench/out/*.json

# vendor/ is NOT ignored on purpose: vendor/tickroom-0.2.0.tgz is the
# dependency itself. The library repo is private, so a git or registry
# dependency would not install on a build machine with no credentials, and a
# committed tarball is the only form that resolves with no auth at all. A
# `vercel` file upload deploy carries it the same way.
